---
import SlideFolio from '@components/deck/SlideFolio.astro';
---

<section class="deck-slide" id="s06-conundrums" data-slot="conundrums">
  <SlideFolio number={6} label="Conundrums" />
  <div class="deck-inner">
    <h2 class="deck-title reveal-item">The “Fund of Funds” model has conundrums.</h2>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-[var(--deck-gap)] md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="deck-panel reveal-item" style="--delay: 140ms">
        <p class="deck-label text-primary vibrant:text-secondary">Plays to averages</p>
        <p class="deck-lede mt-4">A bet on “the average.”</p>
        <p class="deck-body mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
          Venture is a business of taking bold bets on potential outliers, and outliers are what drives returns.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="deck-panel reveal-item" style="--delay: 280ms">
        <p class="deck-label text-primary vibrant:text-secondary">Fees on fees</p>
        <p class="deck-body mt-4 font-mono text-muted-foreground">(2% + 20%) + (1% + 10%)</p>
        <p class="deck-stat mt-3">3% <span class="deck-lede">fees</span> &amp; 30% <span class="deck-lede">carry</span></p>
        <p class="deck-body mt-4 text-muted-foreground">Fees on Fees, Carry on Carry take a huge chunk off a decent return.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
